yResult](UseInfiniteQueryResult.md) instead.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TData\n\n`TData` = `unknown`\n\nThe type `data` ends up as, after `select` runs (if set).\n\n### TError\n\n`TError` = [`DefaultError`](DefaultError.md)\n\nThe type of errors this query may hold.\n"}
